{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-8-1","title":"Isaiah 8:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 In Maher-shalal-hash-baz, he prophesies that Syria and Israel shall be subdued by Assyria. 5 Judah likewise for their infidelity. 9 God's judgments shall be irresistible. 11 Comfort shall be to them that fear God. 19 Great afflictions to idolaters.</p>\n<p>Take thee. Jer 36:2,28,32 write. 30:8; Job 19:23,24; Hab 2:2,3 a man's pen. Re 13:18; 21:17 Maher-shalal-hash-baz. Heb. in making speed to the spoil, hehasteneth the prey. Or, Make speed, etc. hasten, etc.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-2","title":"Isaiah 8:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>I took. Ru 4:2,10,11; 2Co 13:1 Uria. 2Ki 16:10,11; 18:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-3","title":"Isaiah 8:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>went. Heb. approached. the prophetess. Jud 4:4; 2Ki 22:14 she conceived. Ho 1:3-9 Call his name. 7:13,14 Maher-shalal-hash-baz. 1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-4","title":"Isaiah 8:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>before. 7:15,16; De 1:39; Jon 4:11; Ro 9:11 the riches of Damascus, etc. or, he that is before the kingof Assyria shall take away the riches, etc. 10:6-14; 17:3; 2Ki 15:29; 16:9; 17:3,5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-5","title":"Isaiah 8:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>A.M. 3263. B.C. 741. spake 7:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-6","title":"Isaiah 8:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>refuseth. 1Ki 7:16; 2Ch 13:8-18 the waters of Shiloah. Ne 3:15; Joh 9:7 Siloam. that go softly. Jer 2:13,18; 18:14 rejoice. 7:1,2,6; Jud 9:16-20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-7","title":"Isaiah 8:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>the Lord bringeth. 17:12,13; 28:17; 59:19; Ge 6:17; De 28:49-52; Jer 46:7,8; Da 9:26 Da 11:10,22; Am 8:8; 9:5; Na 1:8; Lu 6:48; Re 12:15,16; 17:15 strong. Ezr 4:10; Ps 72:8 the king. 7:1-6,17; 10:8-14; Eze 31:3-18 he shall come. 2Ki 17:3-6; 18:9-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-8","title":"Isaiah 8:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>he shall pass. 10:28-32; 22:1-7; 28:14-22; 29:1-9; 36:1-37:38 reach. 30:28 the stretching, etc. Heb. the fulness of the breadth of thyland shall be the stretchings out of his wings. Eze 17:3 O Immanuel. 7:14; Mt 1:23 Emmanuel. 28:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-9","title":"Isaiah 8:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Associate. 7:1,2; 54:15; Jer 46:9-11; Eze 38:9-23; Joe 3:9-14; Mic 4:11-13 Zec 14:1-3; Re 17:12-14; 20:8,9 and ye. or, yet ye. 14:5,6; 28:13; Ps 37:14,15; Pr 11:21 gird. 37:36; 1Ki 20:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-10","title":"Isaiah 8:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>counsel. 7:5-7; 2Sa 15:31; 17:4,23; Job 5:12; Ps 2:1,2; 33:10,11; 46:1,7 Ps 83:3-18; Pr 21:30; La 3:37; Na 1:9-12; Ac 5:38,39 for God. 7:14; 9:6; 41:10; De 20:1; Jos 1:5; 2Ch 13:12; 33:7,8; Ps 46:7,11 Mt 1:23; 28:20; Ro 8:13,31; 1Jo 4:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-11","title":"Isaiah 8:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>with a strong hand. Heb. in strength of hand. Jer 20:7,9; Eze 3:14; Ac 4:20 instructed. Ps 32:8; Pr 1:15; Jer 15:19; Eze 2:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-12","title":"Isaiah 8:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>not, A confederacy. 7:2-6; 51:12,13; 2Ki 16:5-7 fear ye. 7:4; 57:9-11; Ps 53:5; Mt 28:2-5; Lu 12:4,5; 21:9; 1Pe 3:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-13","title":"Isaiah 8:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Sanctify. 26:3,4; Le 10:3; Nu 20:12,13; 27:14; Ro 4:20 and let him. Ge 31:53; Ps 76:7; Mal 2:5; Mt 10:28; Lu 12:5; Re 15:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-14","title":"Isaiah 8:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>he shall be. 26:20; Ps 46:1,2; Pr 18:10; Eze 11:16 a stone. 28:16; Lu 2:34; Ro 9:32,33; 11:9-11,35; 1Pe 2:8 a snare. Ps 11:6; 69:22; Mt 13:57; Lu 21:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-15","title":"Isaiah 8:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>stumble. Mt 11:6; 15:14; 21:44; Lu 20:17,18; Joh 6:66; 1Co 1:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-16","title":"Isaiah 8:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Bind up. 29:11; Da 12:4 the testimony. 20; De 4:45; 2Ki 11:12; Joh 3:32,33; Heb 3:5; 1Jo 5:9-12; Re 19:10 seal. Da 9:24; Re 5:1,5; 10:4 among. 54:13; Ps 25:14; Pr 8:8,9; Da 12:9,10; Mt 13:11; Mr 4:10,11,34 Mr 10:10; 1Co 2:14; Re 2:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-17","title":"Isaiah 8:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>I will. 25:9; 26:8; 33:2; 64:4; Ge 49:18; Ps 27:14; 33:20; 37:34; 39:7; 40:1 Ps 130:5; La 3:25,26; Ho 12:6; Mic 7:7; Hab 2:3; 1Th 1:10; 2Th 3:5 Heb 10:36-39 hideth. 54:8; 59:2; 64:7; De 31:17,18; 32:20; Eze 39:23,24; Mic 3:4 I will look. 50:10; Lu 2:38; Heb 9:28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-18","title":"Isaiah 8:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>I and the. 3; 7:3,16; 53:10; Ps 22:30; Heb 2:13,14 for signs. Ps 71:7; Eze 14:8; Zec 3:8; Lu 2:34; 1Co 4:9-13; Heb 10:33 which. 12:6; 14:32; 24:23; 1Ch 23:25; Ps 9:11; Zec 8:3; Heb 12:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-19","title":"Isaiah 8:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Seek. 19:3; Le 20:6; De 18:11; 1Sa 28:8; 1Ch 10:13; 2Ch 33:6 that peep. 29:4 should not. 1Sa 28:16; 2Ki 1:3; 2Pe 2:1 for the living. Ps 106:28; Jer 10:10; 1Th 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-20","title":"Isaiah 8:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>the law. 16; Lu 10:26; 16:29-31; Joh 5:39,46,47; Ac 17:11; Ga 3:8-29 Ga 4:21,22; 2Ti 3:15-17; 2Pe 1:19 it is. 30:8-11; Ps 19:7,8; 119:130; Jer 8:9; Mic 3:6; Mt 6:23; 22:29 Mr 7:7-9; Ro 1:22; 2Pe 1:9 light. Heb. morning. Pr 4:18; Ho 6:3; Mal 4:2; 2Pe 1:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-21","title":"Isaiah 8:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>through. 7,8 hardly bestead. 9:20; De 28:33,34,53-57; 2Ki 25:3; Jer 14:18; 52:6; La 4:4,5,9,10 they shall fret. Pr 19:3 curse. Ex 22:28; 2Ki 6:33; Job 1:11; 2:5,9; Re 9:20,21; 16:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-8-22","title":"Isaiah 8:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>look. 5:30; 9:1; 2Ch 15:5,6; Jer 13:16; 30:6,7; Am 5:18-20; Zep 1:14,15 Mt 8:12; 24:29; Lu 21:25,26; Jude 1:13 driven to darkness. Job 18:18; Pr 14:32; Jer 23:12; Mt 22:13</p>"}]}